<title>USA: TABLE - Fuisz Q2 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Fuisz Q2 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>						    June 30,  June 30,</p>
<p>					  1997     1996    1997    1996</p>
<p>  Total operating revenues     $5,895  $3,301  $7,745  $5,962</p>
<p>Operating expenses</p>
<p>  Recurring expenses		6,948   3,405  11,982   5,812</p>
<p>  Non-recurring charges	   2,400	--   2,400	--</p>
<p>  Total operating expenses	9,348   3,405  14,382   5,812</p>
<p> Total other income		   570     738   1,350   1,144</p>
<p> Net income (loss)		(2,883)     634 (5,287)   1,294</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per share   (0.14)    0.03  (0.26)    0.06</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding			20,743  21,583  20,719  20,743</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q2 1997 results include a one-time, non-recurring charge of $2.4 million for an out-of-court settlement of litigation.</p>
<p>Excluding the one-time, non-recurring charge, net loss for the quarter would have been about $483,000, or $0.02 per share and a net loss of about $2,887,000, or $0.14 per share for the current six month period.</p>
</text>
